  · refine ⟨[(1, modeR 1, edgeR 1 2), (2, modeR 2, edgeR 2 2), (2, modeR 2, edgeR 2 2), (2, modeR 2, edgeR 2 2)], ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩
